# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Safety net. No personal data belongs in this repository — ever.
#
# By design the user's configuration lives OUTSIDE the plugin, in the workspace
# ($JOB_HUNT_HOME, default ~/Documents/job_applications). Nothing below should
# ever be created inside a clone. These rules exist because a single careless
# `cp` of a real candidate.md or a LinkedIn export would publish someone's
# identity, address, phone number and employment history in a public repo, and
# git history keeps it there after the delete.
#
# The `templates/*.example.*` files are the ONLY candidate-shaped files that are
# meant to be committed, and they contain a fictional person.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Real configuration and personal records
config.yml
config.yaml
candidate.md
repos.md
commute.md
job-pipeline.md
profile/
workspace/

# Signature images and any scan they were made from
signature*.png
signature*.jpg
signature*.jpeg
signature*.pdf

# Generated application dossiers (YYYYMMDD_Company-Role/)
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]_*/

# Anything a user might drop in while testing
*.pdf
!docs/**/*.pdf
resume.md
cover-letter.md
job-ad.md

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Règles locales, non partagées avec le plugin
CLAUDE.md
